23 |     alg!(a + b)
   |     ---------^-
   |     |        |
   |     |        cannot add `f64` to `f32`
   |     required by a bound introduced by this call
   |
   = help: the trait `AddRhs<f32, f32, _>` is not implemented for `f64`
   = note: operands are never converted implicitly, inside an `#[algebraic]` scope or outside one
   = note: if these are numeric types, cast one of them; if `f32` is not opted in yet, add `reassoc::passthrough!(f32);`, or wrap the expression in `strict!(..)` to use ordinary operators
   = note: if `f32` is a generic type parameter, none of those apply: dispatch is resolved per concrete type, so `#[algebraic]` cannot be used in a generic function
